Z||000001||MontanaFiero||07-04-2001||06:04 PM||||If you are using a PC, click on the "Pennocks Image Poster" button at the bottom of this screen. It's free. If you are using a mac---post your pictures on your web page (almost every Internet Service Provider gives you data storage on their server for this purpose-- a web page) and then insert a link with an img tag to your posts. If you click on edit for this post, you will see how I got my license plate to post. Yes I am a mac fan. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/blee291/fiero/mtfieroplate.jpg"> ||||reg||1
